0. Reference availability
==============================================================================
  PyRhO importable: False
  detail: TypeError: descriptor '__setitem__' requires a 'collections.OrderedDict' object but received a 'PyRhOparameters'

  The trace-against-trace comparison CANNOT be run. PyRhO was not
  patched to make it run: editing the reference until it agrees is not
